# std/bash's image (design/caos-expr.md, Phase 3): this directory is a flake
# (flake.nix + flake.lock + worker), so its image is the flake-builder applied
# to the directory itself. Resolving `/cas/std/bash` evaluates this expression
# — the flake→image step made explicit here rather than left to the server's
# implicit flake detection.
run /std/flake-builder -- --in:@=.
